# Deploy after Git push

This site is a Cloudflare Worker (`sensei-studios`). `git push` updates GitHub only. Production does not change until Cloudflare deploys.

When the user asks to push, commit, or go live:

1. Commit and push as requested.
2. Immediately run `npx wrangler deploy` with full permissions.
3. Confirm the live homepage at `https://senseistudios.com/` shows the new copy before calling it done.

Do not wait for GitHub Actions. Treat Wrangler deploy as part of the same push.
